{"_id":"Tqg24vkbxQGw8MMk","_stats":{"createdTime":0,"modifiedTime":0},"description":"","displayRoll":true,"formula":"1d100","gameSystems":["rt"],"name":"Mutations","replacement":true,"results":[{"_id":"1s2KXvGV6DCdDG3U","drawn":false,"range":[1,30],"text":"<p>Mottled Skin: Patches of the wayfarer’s skin turn grey and rough, like bark after rain.</p>","type":"text","weight":30},{"_id":"BNNzMzwNXR2a5JhA","drawn":false,"range":[31,60],"text":"<p>Webbed Fingers: Thin membranes grow between the fingers; the wayfarer swims with ease.</p>","type":"text","weight":30},{"_id":"MNApj9rT9Zx3EwRz","drawn":false,"range":[61,90],"text":"<p>Lantern Eyes: The wayfarer’s eyes catch the light and glow faintly in the dark.</p>","type":"text","weight":30},{"_id":"9LIH9OZ6qpQFx0hu","drawn":false,"range":[91,100],"text":"<p>Reed Voice: The wayfarer’s voice becomes a thin whistle, carrying far across water.</p>","type":"text","weight":10}],"sort":800000,"system":{"source":{"rt":{"book":"wayfarers-field-manual","page":"4","provenance":"raw"}}}}
